":"dish","r":"dish/cannelloni","n":"Cannelloni","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Italian cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Cannelloni are a cylindrical type of egg-based stuffed pasta generally served baked with a filling and covered by a sauce in Italian cuisine. Popular stuffings include spinach and ricotta or minced beef. The shells are then typically covered with tomato sauce."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-cannelloni"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannelloni"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Italian cuisine","cuisine/italian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pasta Grannies","ref":"site/pastagrannies-substack-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"pastagrannies.substack.com","note":"Vicky Bennison's long-running video series filming Italian grandmothers making regional pasta by hand.","url":"https://pastagrannies.substack.com/p/pasta-grannies-is-now-on-substack","suggested":true,"kind":"youtube"},{"name":"Recipes from Italy","ref":"site/recipesfromitaly-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"recipesfromitaly.com","note":"Traditional Italian recipes written by Italian home cooks, organized by region and course.","url":"https://recipesfromitaly.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Manu's Menu","ref":"site/manusmenu-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"manusmenu.com","note":"Italian-born home cook Manuela sharing classic family and regional Italian dishes.","url":"https://www.manusmenu.com/about/about-this-site","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Italian cuisine","links":[["8½ Otto e Mezzo Bombana","dish/8-otto-e-mezzo-bombana"],["A16 (restaurant)","dish/a16-restaurant"],["Acquacotta","dish/acquacotta"],["Agliata","dish/agliata"],["Agnolotti","dish/agnolotti"],["Alfredo alla Scrofa","dish/alfredo-alla-scrofa"],["Alioto's","dish/alioto-s"],["Amalfi's Italian Restaurant","dish/amalfi-s-italian-restaurant"],["Amato's",